      "id": "45ead891-8a77-4ded-9510-ce12cf3df961",
      "question": "Top team leaders by equivalent new tickets this year",
      "report": {
        "title": "Top team leaders by equivalent new tickets this year",
        "sql": "SELECT u.name AS team_leader_name, COUNT(pt.id) AS equivalent_new_tickets\nFROM product_task pt\nJOIN users u ON pt.assign_team_leader = u.id\nWHERE pt.created_at BETWEEN '2026-01-01' AND '2026-12-31'\n  AND pt.is_deleted = 0\nGROUP BY u.id, u.name\nORDER BY equivalent_new_tickets DESC\nLIMIT 500",
        "explanation": "This query counts the number of new tickets (product_task records) assigned to each team leader during 2026. It joins the product_task table with the users table to get team leader names, filters for non-deleted tasks created within the specified year, groups by team leader, and orders by ticket count descending to show top team leaders.",
        "assumptions": [
          "Interpreted 'this year' as calendar year 2026.",
          "New tickets are defined as product_task records created within the date range",
          "Team leader is identified by the assign_team_leader field in product_task",
          "Only non-deleted tasks (is_deleted = 0) are counted",
          "The created_at field in product_task represents when the ticket was created"
        ],
        "columns": [
          "team_leader_name",
          "equivalent_new_tickets"
        ],
        "sample_rows": [
